        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5088] After receiving a WPT_FinePositioningReq with EVProcessing set to \"Ongoing\", the SECC shall respond with a WPT_FinePositioningRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 218, when the vehicle positioning has finished. The next allowed request shall be WPT_PairingReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 218.",
