            "block_content": "[V2G20-5089] After receiving the WPT_PairingReq with EVProcessing set to \"Finished\", the SECC shall respond with a WPT_PairingRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The next allowed request shall be AuthorizationSetupReq or WPT_FinePositioningSetupReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
