        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5090] After receiving a WPT_PairingReq with EVProcessing set to \"Ongoing\", the SECC shall respond with a WPT_PairingRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Ongoing\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 218, while the pairing process is still ongoing. The next allowed request shall be WPT_PairingReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 218.",
